SUMMARY:Portland Art Museum: Free First Thursday
DESCRIPTION:Category: Arts & Culture\nCost: $27.50 adults\; FREE First Thur
 sday\; $5 Oregon Trail Card (up to 2 tickets)\nInfo: Explore the museum's 
 diverse collections for free. Tickets can be reserved online one week in a
 dvance or at the door. Often includes live DJs\, guided tours\, and specia
 l programming. Part of Portland's First Thursday arts tradition.\nAddress:
  1219 SW Park Ave\, Portland\, OR 97205\nPhone: 503-226-2811\nWebsite: htt
 ps://portlandartmuseum.org/
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//EN"><HTML><BODY><p><strong>Category:</strong> Arts &amp; Culture</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> $27.50 adults; FREE First Thursday; $5 Oregon Trail Card (up to 2 tickets)</p><p>Explore the museum&#x27;s diverse collections for free. Tickets can be reserved online one week in advance or at the door. Often includes live DJs, guided tours, and special programming. Part of Portland&#x27;s First Thursday arts tradition.</p><p><strong>Address:</strong> 1219 SW Park Ave, Portland, OR 97205</p><p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:503-226-2811">503-226-2811</a></p><p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://portlandartmuseum.org/">https://portlandartmuseum.org/</a></p></BODY></HTML>
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
