SUMMARY:OMSI (Oregon Museum of Science and Industry): First Sunday
DESCRIPTION:Category: Arts & Culture\nCost: $22.50 adults (14+)\; $20.50 se
 niors (63+)\; $15.50 youth (3-13)\; free under 3\; $5 First Sunday\; $5 Ar
 ts for All (EBT/SNAP/WIC/TANF/Medicaid/OHP)\nNote: Arts for All provides u
 p to 4 tickets at $5 each for EBT/SNAP/WIC/TANF/Medicaid/OHP recipients (a
 ny state)\; up to 55% off OMSI for 2\, Family\, Family Plus\, and Patron m
 emberships\nInfo: Discounted admission day - only $5 per person for all ex
 hibits. Planetarium shows\, submarine tours\, and special exhibitions also
  $5 each. Purchase tickets online in advance to skip the line. Interactive
  science museum great for families and curious minds.\nAddress: 1945 SE Wa
 ter Ave\, Portland\, OR 97214\nPhone: 503-797-4000\nWebsite: https://omsi.
 edu/
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//EN"><HTML><BODY><p><strong>Category:</strong> Arts &amp; Culture</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> $22.50 adults (14+); $20.50 seniors (63+); $15.50 youth (3-13); free under 3; $5 First Sunday; $5 Arts for All (EBT/SNAP/WIC/TANF/Medicaid/OHP)</p><p><em>Arts for All provides up to 4 tickets at $5 each for EBT/SNAP/WIC/TANF/Medicaid/OHP recipients (any state); up to 55% off OMSI for 2, Family, Family Plus, and Patron memberships</em></p><p>Discounted admission day - only $5 per person for all exhibits. Planetarium shows, submarine tours, and special exhibitions also $5 each. Purchase tickets online in advance to skip the line. Interactive science museum great for families and curious minds.</p><p><strong>Address:</strong> 1945 SE Water Ave, Portland, OR 97214</p><p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:503-797-4000">503-797-4000</a></p><p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://omsi.edu/">https://omsi.edu/</a></p></BODY></HTML>
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
