DESCRIPTION:Category: Arts & Culture\nCost: FREE admission\nInfo: 2026 date
  confirmed as August 1. Draws 400+ visitors - arrive early.\nAddress: 8700
  SW Sweek Drive\, Tualatin\, OR 97062\nPhone: 503-885-1926\nWebsite: https
 ://www.tualatinhistory.org\nDetails: Free local history museum with excell
 ent family events. Fossil Fest is a highlight - 400+ attendees. Re-tiered 
 from annual to quarterly audits in July 2026 - an annual cadence let the w
 hole program list sit a full year stale\, still advertising 2025 dates.
